control: Only the body fetch returns a body, and no metadata type has a field for it
removes: the port's metadata fetch returns each message's body in place of its metadata, with the provider fake changed to match, as a real change of the port changes every implementation
packages: ./provider/mail
tests: TestOnlyTheBodyFetchReturnsABody
scheduled-count: no

